msgid "## 8 Performance Evaluation"
msgstr "## 8 性能评估"

msgid ""
"- The current version is only for early experience, and performance optimization is still in progress.\n"
"- The service reliability has not been fully validated, and it is not recommended for direct use in production environments."
msgstr ""
"- 当前版本仅供早期体验，性能优化仍在进行中。\n"
"- 服务可靠性尚未经过充分验证，不建议直接用于生产环境。"

msgid ""
"| Expert Parallelism (EP) | Distributes the MoE experts across NPUs. | "
"`--enable-expert-parallel` |"
msgstr "| 专家并行（EP） | 将 MoE 专家分布到多个 NPU 上。 | `--enable-expert-parallel` |"

msgid ""
"- `Step-5-Preview` is provided **out-of-the-box** through the official Docker image `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:step5-a5-openeuler`. The supporting code has **not yet been merged** into the vLLM-Ascend repository, so installing it from source (`pip install` or building from source) is **not supported** for this model yet.\n"
"    - Only **950DT products** are supported for this experimental release. Other Ascend hardware (e.g., Atlas A3 Products) is not supported for `Step-5-Preview`.\n"
"    - The features listed in [Supported Features](#2-supported-features) are only those enabled by the verified deployment commands in this document, and do **not** imply that all features are supported for `Step-5-Preview`. This is an early-access version; performance optimization and reliability validation are still in progress (see [Declaration](#102-declaration))."
msgstr ""
"- `Step-5-Preview` 通过官方 Docker 镜像 `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:step5-a5-openeuler` **开箱即用**。相关支持代码**尚未合入** vLLM-Ascend 仓库，因此该模型暂**不支持**从源码安装（`pip install` 或从源码构建）。\n"
"    - 此实验版本仅支持 **Ascend 950DT系列产品**。其他昇腾硬件（例如 Atlas A3系列产品）不支持 `Step-5-Preview`。\n"
"    - [支持的特性](#2-supported-features) 中列出的特性仅为本文件中经过验证的部署命令所启用的特性，**并不**意味着 `Step-5-Preview` 支持所有特性。这是一个早期访问版本，性能优化和可靠性验证仍在进行中（参见 [声明](#102-declaration)）。"

msgid ""
"This document is written based on the custom vLLM Ascend Docker image built "
"on v0.27.0. The supported runtime versions are listed in [Hardware and "
"Software Preparation](#32-hardware-and-software-preparation). The model is "
"supported only in the experimental configuration described in this guide."
msgstr ""
"本文档基于在 v0.27.0 上构建的自定义 vLLM Ascend Docker 镜像编写。支持的运行时版本列于 "
"[硬件与软件准备](#32-hardware-and-software-preparation)。该模型仅支持本指南中描述的实验性配置。"

msgid ""
"The official model is available on [Hugging "
"Face](https://huggingface.co/stepfun-ai/Step-5-Preview). The deployment "
"below uses the Ascend-adapted W8A8-MXFP8 checkpoint from ModelScope; these "
"are different weight formats."
msgstr ""
"官方模型可在 [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/stepfun-ai/Step-5-Preview) "
"上获取。以下部署使用来自 ModelScope 的昇腾适配 W8A8-MXFP8 权重文件；两者是不同的权重格式。"

msgid "This experimental deployment example targets 950DT products only."
msgstr "此实验性部署示例仅面向 Ascend 950DT系列产品。"

msgid ""
"The `docker run` command above opens an interactive container shell. Use "
"that shell for the following steps. To open an additional shell, run this "
"command from another terminal on the host:"
msgstr ""
"上述 `docker run` 命令会打开一个交互式容器 shell。请使用该 shell 执行后续步骤。如需再打开一个 "
"shell，请在宿主机的另一个终端中运行以下命令："

msgid "**Installation Verification:**"
msgstr "**安装验证：**"

msgid ""
"In another terminal on the same host, check the container status (replace "
"`step5` if you changed `CONTAINER_NAME`):"
msgstr "在同一宿主机的另一个终端中，检查容器状态（如果你修改了 `CONTAINER_NAME`，请替换 `step5`）："

msgid ""
"Expected result: The container is listed with status `Up`. In the container "
"terminal, verify the installed package versions:"
msgstr "预期结果：容器状态显示为 `Up`。在容器终端中，验证已安装的软件包版本："

msgid ""
"Expected result: The version information for both packages is displayed, "
"matching the Docker image versions listed in Section 3.2."
msgstr "预期结果：显示两个软件包的版本信息，且与第 3.2 节中列出的 Docker 镜像版本一致。"

msgid ""
"The two-node deployment uses four global DP ranks with TP4 per rank and a "
"total context limit of 1,048,576 tokens. Each host runs two local DP ranks "
"across its eight NPUs. Set `WEIGHT_PATH` to the container-visible checkpoint"
" directory recorded in Section 3.1. Set `NODE0_IP`, `NODE1_IP`, and "
"`NETWORK_INTERFACE` to each host's reachable communication IPs and local "
"network interface. The scripts derive `local_ip`, `node0_ip`, and `IFNAME` "
"from these values. Start both nodes before waiting for the distributed "
"service to become ready."
msgstr ""
"双节点部署使用四个全局 DP rank，每个 rank 使用 TP4，总上下文限制为 1,048,576 个 token。每台主机在其八个 NPU "
"上运行两个本地 DP rank。将 `WEIGHT_PATH` 设置为第 3.1 节中记录的容器内可见的权重文件目录。将 "
"`NODE0_IP`、`NODE1_IP` 和 `NETWORK_INTERFACE` 设置为各主机可通信的 IP "
"地址和本地网络接口。脚本会从这些值中推导出 `local_ip`、`node0_ip` 和 `IFNAME`。请先启动两个节点，再等待分布式服务就绪。"

msgid ""
"After both nodes have joined and node 0 reports `Application startup "
"complete`, check the API from a client that can reach node 0:"
msgstr ""
"在两个节点均已加入且节点 0 报告 `Application startup complete` 后，从能够访问节点 0 的客户端检查 API："

msgid ""
"Expected result: `200`. The headless node does not expose its own HTTP API. "
"If startup fails or the health check does not return `200`, inspect both "
"nodes' logs, confirm the weight path and network settings, and follow the "
"[Public FAQs](../../faqs.md) before sending requests."
msgstr ""
"预期结果：`200`。无头节点不暴露自身的 HTTP API。如果启动失败或健康检查未返回 "
"`200`，请检查两个节点的日志，确认权重路径和网络设置，并在发送请求前参阅 [公共常见问题](../../faqs.md)。"

msgid ""
"Send an inference request to test the service on node 0. The server above "
"binds to `NODE0_IP`, so replace `127.0.0.1` in the following request with "
"that communication IP unless the service is also listening on loopback:"
msgstr ""
"发送推理请求以测试节点 0 上的服务。上述服务器绑定到 `NODE0_IP`，因此除非服务同时监听回环地址，否则请将以下请求中的 `127.0.0.1`"
" 替换为该通信 IP："

msgid ""
"Expected result: HTTP 200 and a JSON body containing a non-empty `choices` "
"field with generated text. The response below is an example; identifiers, "
"generated text, and token counts vary between requests:"
msgstr ""
"预期结果：HTTP 200 以及包含非空 `choices` 字段（含生成文本）的 JSON 响应体。以下响应仅为示例；标识符、生成文本和 token "
"数量会因请求而异："

