msgid ""
"**Run the performance evaluation using the GSM8K dataset as an example:**"
msgstr "**以 GSM8K 数据集为例运行性能评估：**"

msgid "**Expected result:**"
msgstr "**预期结果：**"

msgid ""
"AISBench prints one line per finished request and then a summary table. "
"Check the following fields; the exact values depend on hardware, "
"concurrency, and input/output lengths:"
msgstr "AISBench 会为每个完成的请求打印一行，然后打印汇总表。请检查以下字段；具体数值取决于硬件、并发数以及输入/输出长度："

msgid ""
"- `Request throughput (req/s)`: completed requests per second.\n"
"- `Output token throughput (tok/s)`: generated tokens per second.\n"
"- `Mean TTFT (ms)` / `P99 TTFT (ms)`: time to first token, average and 99th percentile.\n"
"- `Mean TPOT (ms)` / `P99 TPOT (ms)`: time per output token, average and 99th percentile."
msgstr ""
"- `Request throughput (req/s)`：每秒完成的请求数。\n"
"- `Output token throughput (tok/s)`：每秒生成的 token 数。\n"
"- `Mean TTFT (ms)` / `P99 TTFT (ms)`：首 token 时间，平均值和第 99 百分位值。\n"
"- `Mean TPOT (ms)` / `P99 TPOT (ms)`：每个输出 token 的时间，平均值和第 99 百分位值。"

msgid "## 9 Performance Tuning"
msgstr "## 9 性能调优"

msgid "### 9.1 Recommended Configurations"
msgstr "### 9.1 推荐配置"

msgid ""
"Use the commands in [Section 5](#5-online-service-deployment) as starting "
"configurations. They are not globally optimal: the appropriate settings "
"depend on request lengths, concurrency, and the available device memory. "
"Evaluate each adjustment with the same workload and compare latency, "
"throughput, and memory use. This preview does not provide validated single-"
"node or PD-disaggregated alternatives."
msgstr ""
"请将 [第 5 节](#5-online-service-deployment) "
"中的命令作为起始配置。它们并非全局最优：合适的设置取决于请求长度、并发数和可用设备内存。请使用相同的工作负载评估每项调整，并比较延迟、吞吐量和内存使用情况。此预览版本不提供经过验证的单节点或"
" PD 分离替代方案。"

msgid "| Scenario | Starting Configuration | Validation |"
msgstr "| 场景 | 起始配置 | 验证 |"

msgid ""
"| Long context | Multi-node co-located example in Section 5.1 with `max-"
"model-len=1048576`; ensure prompt and generated tokens fit together. | KV-"
"cache capacity and failed requests at the intended concurrency. |"
msgstr ""
