msgid "### 10.1 Source Code Installation Is Not Supported"
msgstr "### 10.1 不支持源码安装"

msgid ""
"**Symptom:** The source installation workflow does not provide the "
"experimental adaptation described here."
msgstr "**现象：** 源码安装流程不提供此处描述的实验性适配。"

msgid ""
"**Cause:** This guide documents the custom image; Section 4.2 states that "
"its supporting code has not yet been merged."
msgstr "**原因：** 本指南介绍的是自定义镜像；第 4.2 节说明其配套代码尚未合入。"

msgid ""
"**Resolution:** Use the Docker image and versions in Sections 3 and 4. Do "
"not substitute a source build while expecting the same preview behavior."
msgstr "**解决方案：** 使用第 3 节和第 4 节中的 Docker 镜像和版本。请勿改用源码构建并期望获得相同的预览行为。"

